png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Price:  14  gp</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"￼START_WIDGET&quot;'-ebe78955a2810d6eEND_WIDGET ￼START_WIDGET&quot;'-846c52b48ce4da6dEND_WIDGET\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">BOOK_LOW_CazadorsPalace_TheBallroomDoor</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:BOOK_LOW_CazadorsPalace_TheBallroomDoor\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:BOOK_LOW_CazadorsPalace_TheBallroomDoor\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">245af725-6ea4-4e16-bd01-0ba14f525d38</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:245af725-6ea4-4e16-bd01-0ba14f525d38\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:245af725-6ea4-4e16-bd01-0ba14f525d38\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>In a desk on the top floor of the <a href=\"/wiki/Szarr_Palace\" title=\"Szarr Palace\">Szarr Palace</a> at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-1243 &nbsp;Y:&nbsp;978</span></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>Chamberlain Dufay-\n</p><p><br>\nThe <a href=\"/wiki/Kozakuran_Dictionary\" title=\"Kozakuran Dictionary\">Kozakuran Dictionary</a> we use to train new servants on how to operate the Ballroom door has gone missing, and my <a href=\"/wiki/Szarr_Family_Ring\" title=\"Szarr Family Ring\">Signet Ring</a> alone won't do the job. Please have the servants sort this out, it shouldn't be my problem to solve.\n</p><p><br>\n-Godey\n</p><p><br>\n[The note continues in different handwriting.]\n</p><p><br>\nGodey-\n</p><p><br>\nThe servants and I are thoroughly busy preparing for the Master's celebration. Get your bones out of the Kennel and search every chamber on the vampire spawn level, and quickly. Find that book.\n</p>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714202457\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.056 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.059 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1651/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 29260/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 7453/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 29/200\nExpensive parser function count: 2/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.011/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 9